sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.leaves.index)"
    participant Controller as "Employee LeaveController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Klik Export (PDF/Excel/CSV)
    View->>Controller: GET /employee/leaves/export?filter&format
    Controller->>Model: Build filter export sesuai pegawai login
    Model->>DB: SELECT leave_requests + relasi leave_type/approver
    DB-->>Model: Dataset export
    Model-->>Controller: Data siap diekspor

    alt Data valid (format valid & data tersedia)
        Controller->>View: Return file pdf/xlsx/csv
        View-->>Pegawai: File cuti berhasil diunduh
    else Data tidak valid (worker tidak ada/filter error/format invalid)
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal ekspor cuti
    end
